  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delegated cooperation supporting transparency in Bosnia and Herzegovina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to address issues pertaining to democracy, rule of law, accountability and corruption in Bosnia and Herzegovina. Danish support will be provided as an earmarked contribution to support implementation of Transparency Internationals Bosnia and Herzegovina Anti-Corruption Strategy 2021-2030 via a delegated cooperation agreement with Swedish International Development Cooperation Agency, who will be managing the grant. The Anti-Corruption Strategy 2021-2030 is a strategic framework for the actions of Transparency International Bosnia and Herzegovina (TI BiH) that is based on the TI BiH vision and mission.</narrative>
  </description>
